{
  "id": "300",
  "title": "Little Ming Goes to the Dentist",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-08-20",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming needs to go to the dentist, but wants to find a way to let the doctor know when it hurts.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/496/1a277ff89a6498f7f4bd961913b209b8c9c13397.mp3?1500800880",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "小明看牙\n\n    小明牙疼，要去医院看牙。小明怕疼，但看牙时说不了话，怎么办呢？\n    他想到了一个好办法。他在去医院前，把自己说的“好疼啊”录到了手机里。在看牙时，一觉得疼就按播放。一时间，“好疼啊，好疼啊”响个不停。\n    旁边的护士笑个不停，最后，医生忍无可忍，把小明的手机收走了。",
    "traditional": "小明看牙\n\n    小明牙疼，要去醫院看牙。小明怕疼，但看牙時說不了話，怎麼辦呢？\n    他想到了一個好辦法。他在去醫院前，把自己說的“好疼啊”錄到了手機裡。在看牙時，一覺得疼就按播放。一時間，“好疼啊，好疼啊”響個不停。\n    旁邊的護士笑個不停，最後，醫生忍無可忍，把小明的手機收走了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming Goes to the Dentist"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明牙疼，要去医院看牙。",
      "traditional": "小明牙疼，要去醫院看牙。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yá téng yào qù yī yuàn kàn yá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "小明怕疼，但看牙时说不了话，怎么办呢？",
      "traditional": "小明怕疼，但看牙時說不了話，怎麼辦呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng pà téng dàn kàn yá shí shuō bù liǎo huà zěn me bàn ne",
      "english": "Little Ming's tooth hurt, and he had to go to the hospital to see the dentist."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming was afraid it would hurt, but you can't speak when having your teeth examined, so what was he to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "他想到了一个好办法。",
      "traditional": "他想到了一個好辦法。",
      "pinyin": "tā xiǎng dào le yí ge hǎo bàn fǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他在去医院前，把自己说的“好疼啊”录到了手机里。",
      "traditional": "他在去醫院前，把自己說的“好疼啊”錄到了手機裡。",
      "pinyin": "tā zài qù yī yuàn qián bǎ zì jǐ shuō de hǎo téng a lù dào le shǒu jī lǐ",
      "english": "He came up with a great method."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "在看牙时，一觉得疼就按播放。",
      "traditional": "在看牙時，一覺得疼就按播放。",
      "pinyin": "zài kàn yá shí yì jué de téng jiù àn bō fàng",
      "english": "Before going to the hospital, he recorded himself saying “It hurts!” on his mobile phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "一时间，“好疼啊，好疼啊”响个不停。",
      "traditional": "一時間，“好疼啊，好疼啊”響個不停。",
      "pinyin": "yì shí jiān hǎo téng a hǎo téng a xiǎng ge bù tíng",
      "english": "At the dentist, as soon as it hurt he pressed the play button."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In a moment, a voice saying “It hurts, it hurts!” played without end."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "旁边的护士笑个不停，",
      "traditional": "旁邊的護士笑個不停，",
      "pinyin": "páng biān de hù shi xiào ge bù tíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "最后，医生忍无可忍，把小明的手机收走了。",
      "traditional": "最後，醫生忍無可忍，把小明的手機收走了。",
      "pinyin": "zuì hòu yī shēng rěn wú kě rěn bǎ xiǎo míng de shǒu jī shōu zǒu le",
      "english": "The nurse standing next to him couldn't stop laughing."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In the end, the doctor couldn't bear it anymore and took away Little Ming's phone."
    }
  ],
